Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:16.09,Default,Examiner,0,0,0,,Examinee Number 20, come forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:23.38,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The knight selection exam is the \Nempire's largest annual event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.30,top,ManB,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:21.81,top,ManC,0,0,0,,Come on, man! I've bet it all on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:30.44,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The official name of the nation everyone \Ncalls "the empire" is the Meeres Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:33.58,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,"Meeres" is an ancient  word \Nmeaning "warrior."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:37.85,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Indeed, in the Meeres Empire, \Na nation of warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:42.19,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,military might is the one and only \Npath to merit-based success,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:46.79,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and that success is decided \Nby the knight selection exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:52.22,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The exam draws the attention \Nof many in the empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:54.18,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,but this year, in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:59.92,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,sees a prince personally serving as \Nthe head judge, a first in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:06.16,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,People have gathered at the venue \Nin droves for a chance to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:24.84,Default,Examiner,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:28.36,Default,ManC,0,0,0,,It's just no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:32.13,Default,ManB,0,0,0,,Wow... No one can even \Nlay a finger on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.70,Default,ManB,0,0,0,,So that's the Wise Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.91,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,This year's exam is \Nconsidered far
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:47.15,Default,Cruz,0,0,0,,more exciting than those of past years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.77,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What's important is the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:54.71,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The knight selection exam is \Nfor choosing worthy soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:58.03,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.92,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,what sort of fighter Noah chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:04.22,Default,Examiner,0,0,0,,Examinee Number 152, come forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.56,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,The sun will be setting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:36.94,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,No particularly noteworthy \Ncandidates today, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:42.92,Default,Examiner,0,0,0,,The next test will be \Nthe last of the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:05.36,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,This... won't... stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:20.67,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sor—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:21.57,Default,GuardA,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.65,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.47,Default,Spectator1,0,0,0,,Boy, she's really done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.65,Default,Spectator2,0,0,0,,She actually wounded the prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.46,Default,Spectator3,0,0,0,,The law's gonna come down hard on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:37.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:40.27,Default,GuardA,0,0,0,,B-But, Your Highness, this woman just...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.81,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I said, let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.51,Default,GuardA,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:46.52,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:50.35,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,M-My name is Shirley Grantz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.57,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:01.00,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I didn't name my standards,\Nbut she's clearly an instant pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:02.24,Default,Spectator1,0,0,0,,She passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:04.87,Default,Spectator2,0,0,0,,He's forgiving the woman who wounded him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.99,Default,Spectator3,0,0,0,,How generous His Highness is!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\c&H4F7C81&\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\pos(320,142.5)}Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fade(109,0)\p1\bord2\c&H291505&\alpha&H255&\3c&H2986A5&\fscx87\pos(311,141.167)}m 0 0 l 235 0 l 225 8 l 235 15 l 18 15 l 30 8 l 18 0
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:43.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That's some fine armor.\NDo you own it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:47.15,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. It's been handed down \Nin my family for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:48.83,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Anyway, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:52.58,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,what did you mean when you \Nsaid... that I passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.43,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,What is my sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:57.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,For wounding me "by mistake," you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:58.82,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:01.36,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There is no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:03.37,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I told you to attack me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:10.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Stand. Use that thrust on me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.31,0:06:11.23,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.68,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If you are a knight, \Nthen follow my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:16.32,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:26.97,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:33.62,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,One... more...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:38.38,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,What is this? It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:42.43,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This is what I could have done if I'd \Nreally wanted to block your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:45.22,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You did not wound me "by mistake."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:49.74,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,A knight's job is to follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:53.17,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I wanted to see if you would \Nexecute my orders faithfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:57.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I don't need a knight who's going \Nto hold back for fear of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:01.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You came at me in earnest twice, \Neven after wounding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:03.82,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:06.03,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Your resolve was that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:14.61,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,I, Shirley Grantz, swear my undying \Nloyalty to you for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:15.71,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.91,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,That exaggerated gesture \NI've seen in plays...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:22.07,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,It's not formally recognized, \Nbut it gets her intent across.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.29,0:07:31.01,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFCF4&\3c&HCDAFA0&\bord0.75\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H7D605F&\pos(14,20)}Name: Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat \NSex: Male \NTitle: Wise Prince \NLevel: 1\h/\h∞ \NHP: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFire: F \NMP: F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWater: E+S\NStrength: F+E\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWind: F\NStamina: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEarth: F\NIntelligence: F+F\h\h\hLight: F \NSpirit: F+F\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDark: F \NSpeed: F+F \NDexterity: F+F \NLuck: F+F
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:31.01,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord2\shad2\blur1\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&H392E2D&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 265 0 265 85 0 85
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:28.32,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,As far as people go, Shirley \Nhas raised my stats the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.00,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:35.47,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\bord1\fade(273,432)\c&HECF1FD&\3c&H5F6369&\pos(40.667,245)}Good Croy\N{\fs13}Emperor's Doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.67,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I've brought the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.72,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Now you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:40.09,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This is a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:45.65,Default,Good,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the strike didn't \Nhit any bones or organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.30,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:48.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:54.04,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Oh, well... I was impressed that a \Ncut could be treated in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.81,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,We have no doctors in \Nmy village, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:58.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:01.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Then what do you do with \Nyour sick and injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.38,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,We have our elder pray for them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.81,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,or exorcise the root of their illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:09.58,Default,Good,0,0,0,,That's quite common in poor villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.97,Default,Good,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:16.65,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The quickest way to become a doctor \Nis to start as an apprentice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:17.39,Default,Good,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:21.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Shirley, here is your first order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:23.11,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:27.43,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Bring the most clever, hard-working \Npeople from your village to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:32.76,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good, take a few of them as \Nyour apprentices, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:34.55,Default,Good,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.24,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll cover all expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:44.30,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Bring me anyone up to the task of\Nbeing a doctor to examine villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:48.21,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.90,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Knights don't bow like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.45,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You need to brush up \Non knightly etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.46,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Ah, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.42,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.41,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:31.83,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Not very, since I was\Nin an unfamiliar room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:36.06,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,I guess even the servants' quarters \Nare luxurious under a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:39.35,Default,Jessie,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.39,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,That sounds nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:43.86,Default,Jessie,0,0,0,,Then perhaps a poor, downtrodden \Nmaiden at a ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.69,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds lovely, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.02,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Reina, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.04,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Oh, Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:49.39,Default,Jessie,0,0,0,,And Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.39,0:09:54.74,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,We were just imagining what sort of \Nlady might become our master's bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.31,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:56.74,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,He's only six years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.14,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,That's very naïve, Shirley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:04.17,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,The other princes were married \Nbefore they turned fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:07.35,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,Oh! What about the daughter \Nof Anju of Almeria?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:09.12,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,They're in the master's fief!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.21,Default,Jessie,0,0,0,,Yes! She would be a good fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:14.63,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Really, this is so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:17.04,Default,Veteran MaidC,0,0,0,,That's just how loved His Highness is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:20.57,Default,Veteran MaidC,0,0,0,,You've seen all the cafés that \Nhave sprung up on the street
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.52,Default,Veteran MaidC,0,0,0,,in front of the house, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:25.27,Default,Veteran MaidC,0,0,0,,It's because so many girls gather there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:28.37,Default,Veteran MaidC,0,0,0,,hoping to see the prince, or if they're \Nvery lucky, to catch his eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.73,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Wh-What a way to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:33.53,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,Evelyn says all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:37.65,Default,Anna,0,0,0,,that there is no prince anywhere \Nwho's kinder than our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.94,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,You love him yourself, don't you, Zoey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:41.86,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:43.08,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Er, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:47.72,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Liar. You've even started \Nstudying magic lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.54,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,all for the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.06,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Y-You misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.60,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I just want to be useful to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:58.01,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,I'm happy just to be able to serve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.63,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.01,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,You have to admire her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.06,Default,Maids,0,0,0,,She's just so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:10.08,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,The knight selection exam is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:14.07,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Here is the report on this \Nyear's knight selection exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.10,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:18.45,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Thanks to your screening method,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:20.45,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,all of this year's new \Nknights are excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.54,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,The knights have expressed \Ntheir gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:29.16,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Tell them that I'm grateful for \Ntheir help in running it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.55,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,You honor us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:34.45,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Shirley, see our guest out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.25,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,At once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.39,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:45.54,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking the \Ntrouble to pay us a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.35,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,We're both knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:52.26,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,Such formality is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:55.41,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Oh, I beg your pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:56.67,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:12:02.02,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,He sent you to see off this lowly \Nknight as part of your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:04.37,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,His Highness did this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:07.11,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,As your senior, let me give \Nyou a word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.98,0:12:10.58,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,You can't go wrong if you stick with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.50,Default,Rowen,0,0,0,,You'd best work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:14.84,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:27.11,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,Every time I spin around, \Nthe cold wind blows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:36.76,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,In the cold, the folds of my \Nheart tremble and they cry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:44.78,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,My dearest love, if there's an \Nanswer, I will find it on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.62,Default,Cyndi,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:49.75,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Allow me to congratulate you on the \Nsuccess of the knight selection exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:49.75,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,Please fill this night, even with a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:13:00.66,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,Because I ended up meeting \Nyou, my heart is singing now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:53.41,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes, but this party is to \Nshow my thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:57.67,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't waste all your time here. \NGo and enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:58.67,Default,Byron/Cyndi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:00.57,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:07.97,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,It sings of you, reaching only you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:06.34,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,All here are merchants with deep ties\Nto the Thirteenth Prince's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:07.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:10.94,Default,Byron,0,0,0,,Yes. I will go and cultivate \Nsome friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:16.39,italicstop,Alichey,0,0,0,,Even in the next life... \NI want to meet you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:26.17,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:27.07,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:31.42,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Well... I wasn't sure if \NI should pass this along,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:34.17,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,but this is addressed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.42,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's nothing written on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:43.71,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,The guard at the door said the \Nperson who delivered it ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:47.88,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,It may contain classified information, \Nso I brought it just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.70,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That was the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:51.33,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:53.00,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,That's dangerous! Allow me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.13,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.85,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:08.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It seems there's some unsettling movement \Namong the remnants of the Almerian rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:11.46,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,They still haven't given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:12.90,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:16.37,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Whoever delivered this has gone \Nback to investigate undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.04,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It's the soldier from back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:22.28,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The same one
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.75,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,who informed me of the \Nrebellion not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:27.84,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:31.23,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,That man did seem to \Nadmire you a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.05,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:37.60,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,He found out later that the master had \Nalready learned of the rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:40.97,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,but had accepted his warning \Nwithout mentioning so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.20,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,So he's doing this to repay the debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.56,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Well done, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:45.93,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:52.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Playing pretend-spy when you've \Nhad no training is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:54.18,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,If he's exposed, he'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:55.20,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:58.75,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,My brother Henry should \Nstill be near there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:02.00,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll send a message asking him \Nto stop this. Get it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.17,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:27.51,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:31.27,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,As I expected, he was \Nexposed and then tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:38.12,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,He should have just talked, but he \Nrefused, so they showed no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:43.05,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,My brother's unit got him out, \Nbut he's still unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.53,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:49.97,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,No! There's nothing you could have done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:54.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No, if I'd realized it sooner, \NI could have stopped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:58.83,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,If I had put the emperor's "information\Nis a weapon" lesson into practice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:02.61,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.61,0:16:03.41,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:05.99,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Send Almeria this message:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:10.50,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,"I will spare no expense. \NJust don't let that man die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:13.49,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Whatever he needs, be it money \Nor a doctor, tell me."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.48,Default,Zoey,0,0,0,,All right, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.32,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,A single piece of information
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:27.50,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,is not worth the sacrifice \Nof such a deeply loyal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:37.63,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,So many things I've never seen before...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.68,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,No distractions.\NYou're on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:41.97,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:46.50,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Are you here to buy something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:47.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:50.61,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,To thank my brother Henry for \Nsuppressing the rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:52.01,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and for his letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.59,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:17:00.80,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,In that case, I received a\Nshipment I'm sure you'll appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:01.72,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:25.86,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.72,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel the same as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.15,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Sharp as always, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:32.07,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,You figured it out with \None look, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.03,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is this... glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:47.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You can make things like \Nthis out of glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:52.03,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,It was left behind by the uncommonly \Nskilled artisan, Lindsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:54.99,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,As it is a lost art now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:58.70,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,only two goddess statues \Nlike this still exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:05.81,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,All right, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is 10,000 enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.58,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,More than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.50,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,There's more than 10,000 in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:18.05,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The extra is your reward for \Nshowing me such a fine piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.25,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:21.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hey, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:28.33,nameplate,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fade(273,432)\pos(542.667,266)\c&HE2E8EA&\3c&H5A5958&}Oscar Ararat\N{\fs13}Eighth Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:25.72,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,When I came into the store, \Nthey told me you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:27.62,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:31.15,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't\NHis Highness the Eighth Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:32.78,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Welcome to my store!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:37.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I wondered if maybe you'd \Nfind a nice... treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.57,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,A glass goddess statue... \NWhich means it's Lindsey's?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:46.12,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:51.35,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Well, rats. Only two in existence, \Nand you found the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:54.11,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You know where the other one is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:55.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:59.32,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:09.95,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:11.84,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:15.08,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Don't worry. The payment is still yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:17.06,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,And this is for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:22.14,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The second goddess statue was \Nfound, but it was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.92,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Spread that rumor.\NJust around Cobalt Street is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:31.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Incredible. This will greatly raise \Nthe value of my goddess statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:34.77,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,When it comes to treasure, \Nthe fastest wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:39.90,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It may be disrespectful to Lindsey, but if \Nit makes yours more valuable, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:43.59,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,There's a big difference between \Njust one in existence and two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:50.50,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I didn't achieve that kind of mastery \Nuntil I was an adult with my own fief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:53.16,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll thank you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:54.65,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.53,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,I'll be choosing a different gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.97,Default,Bardsley,0,0,0,,I still have many to choose from!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:14.02,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:19.27,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Oh, just that it's been nothing but \Nsurprises since I started serving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:21.31,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.31,0:20:24.20,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Like today... I understand \Nyour reasoning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.28,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,but to destroy such a treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:28.33,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,It was only an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.84,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Real treasures are nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:36.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Those who risk their lives \Nto bring me information.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:42.13,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Those who work their hardest \Nto live up to my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.98,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Those who swear loyalty to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:47.80,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,and dedicate their all to being \Nuseful in any way they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs11\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&HD6C0C2&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(210.667,46)}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs11\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&HD6C0C2&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(246,46)}Thirteenth Imperial Prince Noah Ararat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&HD6C0C2&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(211.333,68)}Sex
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&HD6C0C2&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(247.333,68)}Male
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&HA89DA1&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(211,87.999)}Level
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&H75676A&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(343,157)}Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&H75676A&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(343,178)}Water
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&H75676A&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(216.5,200)}Strength
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:50.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HE9DEDD&\3c&H75676A&\bord0.5\blur1\b1\shad1\4c&H2F3E54&\pos(343,200)}Wind
