Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:54.25,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,The real treasures are people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:05.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 205)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:05.53,sign_generic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\b1\fade(527,722)\c&H00070B&\pos(320, 225)}People Are Treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:11.29,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,That includes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.20,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,M-Me, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:17.40,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,You seem to have learned a lot \Nabout me in the past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.97,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.06,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,He's like the benevolent \Nrulers I've seen in plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:26.64,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:29.40,Default,Shirley,0,0,0,,I will follow you\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.54,Default,Noah,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:33.79,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,An adult with a fief...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:37.31,italics,Noah,0,0,0,,I want to keep collecting treasures \Nuntil I reach that point, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:55.62,Default,Reina,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:57.58,Default,Jessie/Anna,0,0,0,,Take care.
